abstract: >-
  A 4-phase DevSecOps transformation methodology (Assess → Design → Implement → Optimize) operationalizing the principles in the DevSecOps Framework. Includes RACI matrices for accountability, 90-day phased playbooks, DORA metrics integration, and an organizational change management overlay. Designed for regulated environments adopting Executive Order 14028 mandates and NIST SP 800-218 (SSDF).
keywords:
  - devsecops-methodology
  - 4-phase
